# Copy to .dev.vars (git ignored) for local development. The Worker reads it
# at request time, like a Cloudflare secret.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY sends the contact form's enquiries (spec 0022). Without it the
# form still works up to the send, then shows its delivery failure message.
# In production it is a Cloudflare secret on the live Worker, set once with:
#   pnpm exec wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
# Use a key with "Sending access" only. Locally, pair it with CONTACT_TO_EMAIL
# in .env so test enquiries reach you, not the team.

# RESEND_API_KEY=""
